  {
   "text": "The Lyadski Gates were mentioned in 1151.",
   "chunk": 12,
   "date_text": "1151",
   "date": "1151",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#12"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lyadksi Gates were destroyed during the storm of the city by the Mongol army of Batu Khan in 1240.",
   "chunk": 12,
   "date_text": "1240",
   "date": "1240",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#12"
  },
  {
   "text": "The new Pecherski Gates were erected sometime during the 18th century.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "the 18th century",
   "date": null,
   "approximate": true,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [
    "approximate_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "The new Pecherski Gates stood until 1833.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "1833",
   "date": "1833",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "The first wooden dwellings were built on the site in the 1830s.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "the 1830s",
   "date": null,
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stone buildings appeared in the 1850s.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "the 1850s",
   "date": null,
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "Taras Shevchenko lived in that area in 1859.",
   "chunk": 13,
   "date_text": "1859",
   "date": "1859",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#13"
  },
  {
   "text": "Until 1871, it was called the Khreshchatitskaya Ploshchad.",
   "chunk": 14,
   "date_text": "1871",
   "date": "1871",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#14"
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1876, the Kyiv City Duma building was built here.",
   "chunk": 14,
   "date_text": "1876",
   "date": "1876",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#14"
  },
  {
   "text": "The first electric tram built in the Russian Empire opened in 1892.",
