   "date_text": "1892",
   "date": "1892",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#15"
  },
  {
   "text": "The tram line reached the square in 1894.",
   "chunk": 15,
   "date_text": "1894",
   "date": "1894",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 3,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#15"
  },
  {
   "text": "In 1913, a monument of Pyotr Stolypin was constructed in front of the City Duma.",
