   "date_text": "until 1969",
   "date": "1969",
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 5,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#20"
  },
  {
   "text": "The square was given its current name after Ukraine's independence.",
