   "approximate": false,
   "section": 6,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#25"
  },
  {
   "text": "Students protests and hunger strikes known as the Revolution on Granite at the Maidan resulted in the resignation of Vitaliy Masol.",
