   "date_text": "autumn of 1990",
   "date": "1990",
   "approximate": true,
   "section": 6,
   "flags": [
    "approximate_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#26"
  },
  {
   "text": "The biggest political protests in Ukraine, such as the Ukraine without Kuchma campaign and the Orange Revolution, took place in this square.",
   "chunk": 27,
   "date_text": "the 2000s",
   "date": null,
   "approximate": false,
   "section": 6,
   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#27"
  },
  {
   "text": "During the Orange Revolution, Maidan Nezalezhnosti received global media coverage.",
