   "approximate": true,
   "section": 6,
   "flags": [
    "approximate_date"
   ],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#27"
  },
  {
   "text": "The 2009 Batkivshchyna party congress brought nearly 200,000 people to the square.",
