   "flags": [],
   "cid": "/wiki/Maidan_Nezalezhnosti#31"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ukrainian police reported a 55-year-old man from Western Ukraine found dead hanging from the framework of a huge artificial New Year tree in central Kyiv.",
